---
import BaseLayout from '../../components/layout/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Research — Alexis 智立"
  description="Research themes, questions, and methods."
  mycelium="subtle"
>
  <article class="container reading">
    <header class="about-sub-header">
      <h1><span lang="zh">研究</span> · Research</h1>
      <p class="about-sub-intro" lang="zh">关注社区、自组织，以及空间如何影响集体生活的长期问题。</p>
      <p class="about-sub-intro" lang="en">
        Long-term questions around communities, self-organization, and how
        spaces mediate collective life.
      </p>
    </header>

    <section>
      <h2><span lang="zh">研究主题</span> · Themes</h2>
      <p lang="zh">这里持续梳理研究主题：社区如何形成和延续，不同类型的共居与替代性空间如何出现，以及如何记录和理解它们。</p>
      <p lang="en">
        This page is a place to collect and refine research themes over time:
        how communities form and sustain themselves, how different kinds of
        co-living and alternative spaces emerge, and how they might be
        documented and understood.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2><span lang="zh">研究问题</span> · Questions</h2>
      <p lang="zh">这里汇集在不同项目和写作中反复出现的问题。这些问题贯穿更长期的探索。</p>
      <p lang="en">This section brings together questions that recur across projects and writing as part of a longer inquiry.</p>
    </section>

    <p class="back-link">
      <a href="/about">← <span lang="zh">返回关于页面</span> · Back to About</a>
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .about-sub-header {
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }
  .about-sub-intro {
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }
  .back-link {
    margin-top: 3rem;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }
  .back-link a {
    color: var(--color-text-soft);
  }
  .back-link a:hover {
    color: var(--color-accent);
  }
</style>

